No edits outside the allowed glob. project.yml already globs TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets
into both app targets + both XCTest bundles; .swiftlint.yml already includes that path;
strings resolve via NSLocalizedString(value:) English fallback (no shared-catalog edit
needed). Naming note: the surface's security DTO is AuditSecurityEventInput — the bare
name SecurityEventInput is already owned by feature-views/EventHistoryTable.Adapter.swift
in the single app module (a different SecuritySignal-based shape); reusing it caused an
"ambiguous for type lookup" collision, resolved by the Audit-prefixed name.

